<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Lower Colorado River, Texas.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Lower Colorado River, Texas.</headline>
<text>
<p>LOWER COLORADO RIVER AUTHORITY, TEXAS</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000</p>
<p>POLLUTION CONTROL REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SAMSUNG AUSTIN SEMICONDUCTOR, L.L.C. PROJECT</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>Effective at 10:15 P.M. E.D.T., Friday, April 18, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
